// fix-health-app-v2.4.8.cjs — Family Health Track v2.4.8 one-step fix
// Run from the project root (the folder with package.json) with:
//   node fix-health-app-v2.4.8.cjs
// Requires v2.4.7 already applied (run fix-health-app-v2.4.7.cjs first if you
// are still on v2.4.6). What it does:
//   1. Backs up each changed file to <file>.bak (first run only)
//   2. Applies the v2.4.8 fixes (reminders really fire, delete confirm,
//      family switcher, dead features reconnected, tab strip, loading state,
//      admin panels collapsible, bigger text/buttons, history paging+search,
//      Burmese labels, version history)
//   3. Runs npm install, typecheck (tsc), tests (vitest) and build
// Safe to run twice: files already matching the new content are skipped.
// It does NOT touch your data, your Firebase project, or git.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// NOTE — if serviceAccountKey.json is still in this folder, revoke/rotate
// the key in Firebase Console > Project Settings > Service accounts, then
// delete the file. This script only warns about it; it cannot revoke it.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
